### health
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json


### project: create new with success
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/project/new
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Project - 3",
  "origin": "https://home.acme.com",
  "title": "Google analytics - Home"
}

### project: create new with failure
